{"id":"01_5452","type":"item","name":{"ja":"HG 1/144 ズゴック(SEED FREEDOM Ver.)","en":"HG 1/144 Z'Gok (SEED FREEDOM Ver.)"},"description":[{"ja":"『機動戦士ガンダム SEED FREEDOM』で印象的な活躍をする「ズゴック」が、HGで待望の立体化！","en":"\"Z'Gok \", who played an impressive role in \" Mobile Suit Gundam SEED FREEDOM\", has been made into a long-awaited HG figure!"},{"ja":"• 独自の「SEEDアクションシステム」を内蔵。躍動感あふれるダイナミックなポージングを再現可能。","en":"• Built-in unique \"SEED action system\". It is possible to reproduce dynamic poses full of dynamism."},{"ja":"• HGズゴック独自の「SEEDアクションシステム」により、腕・脚の蛇腹のしなりや腹部の大きな動きなどが再現可能。","en":"• HG Z'Gok's unique \"SEED Action System\" allows you to reproduce the bellows of the arms and legs and the large movements of the abdomen."},{"ja":"• パーツの差し替えで、頭部装甲のダメージ状態を再現可能。","en":"• By replacing parts, it is possible to reproduce the damage state of the head armor."},{"ja":"• 赤熱時のクローパーツが付属。通常のクローと差し替えることで劇中イメージを再現できる。","en":"• Claw parts for red heat are included. By replacing it with a regular claw, you can recreate the image from the movie."},{"ja":"• 内部フレームの形状は「インフィニットジャスティスガンダム弐式」を模している。選択式で別売りの「HG 1/144 インフィニットジャスティスガンダム弐式」の一部を組み込むことも可能。","en":"• The shape of the internal frame is modeled after \"Infinite Justice Gundam Type 2 \". It is also possible to incorporate a part of the optional \" HG 1/144 Infinite Justice Gundam Type 2\" sold separately."}],"accessories":[{"ja":"バックパック×1","en":"Backpack x 1"},{"ja":"赤熱時クロー×2","en":"Red heat claw x2"},{"ja":"ダメージ頭部装甲×1","en":"Damage head armor x1"},{"ja":"ビームエフェクト×4","en":"Beam effect x 4"},{"ja":"シール×1","en":"Seal×1"}],"contents":[],"images":["https://d3bk8pkqsprcvh.cloudfront.net/hobby/jp/product/2025/04/BKPyEfMyrSTy7Qnn/AQKZJvgW71UHnBuX.jpeg?Expires=1765044056&Key-Pair-Id=K7AVJM1114TH7&Signature=CDcJ-ATGMDLeS7SMXV2GklrjErWJ3WjbvyXN5GAuJHs1zwuKanYh8H~WJdownf~V0oMU1U0mBhRurIxnnTPrBHbKLHijIlTW4bz8H0xS08Yk4TlURGeghXXMavfTKo5uK4jlRPeNwg9LVybFlQDgvpkMq0tmF4ePxfNRnq3-2N9RU49YtGyyJOxaHFKv0g479mb9TiWroV-28AHGVYOGWk~XDovciDZm8PmqWbDceRaQ49aHrLhsmPnzvEKFU7pZH